      "preview": "גָּלַח: verbo: ser calvo, raspar, rapar; Piel, Pual e Hitpael.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גָּלַח</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo. ser calvo (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">جَلِحَ</span> <strong>)</strong>;<br><strong>Piel</strong>  <strong>raspar, rapar (</strong>assim no hebraico novo e no aramaico<strong>)</strong>—perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וְגִלַּח</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.8\">Lv 14.8</a> + 2 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">וְגִלְּחוֹ</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.26\">2Sm 14.26</a>; 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">וְגִלְּחָה</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.12\">Dt 21.12</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגַלַּח</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.9\">Lv 14.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.20\">Is 7.20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגַלֵּ֑חַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.33\">Lv 13.33</a> + 2 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְגַלַּח</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:14\" href=\"/Genesis.41.14\">Gn 41.14</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.4\">2Sm 10.4</a>; com sufixo (3.ª pessoa masculina singular) <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגַלְּחֶנּוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְגַלְּחֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.4\">1Cr 19.4</a>; 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתְּגַלַּח</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:19\" href=\"/Judges.16.19\">Jz 16.19</a>; 3.ª pessoa masculina plural <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגַלֵּ֑חוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.5\">Lv 21.5</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.20\">Ez 44.20</a>; infinitivo com sufixo do sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּלְּחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.26\">2Sm 14.26</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>raspar</em>, objeto: a cabeça, <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:9\" href=\"/Numbers.6.9\">Nm 6.9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:18\" href=\"/Numbers.6.18\">Nm 6.18</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.12\">Dt 21.12</a> (o cabelo como portador de impureza, cf. RS<sup>Sem i 407</sup>), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.26\">2Sm 14.26</a><sup>(×2)</sup> cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.26\">2Sm 14.26</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.20\">Ez 44.20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.33\">Lv 13.33</a> (P), objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנֶּתֶק</span>; objeto: pessoas <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.4\">1Cr 19.4</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>rapar</em>, o cabelo <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׂעָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.8\">Lv 14.8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.9\">Lv 14.9</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (P) cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:19\" href=\"/Judges.16.19\">Jz 16.19</a>; a barba <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.5\">Lv 21.5</a> (H) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.4\">2Sm 10.4</a>. <strong>3.</strong>  figuradamente, da devastação pelos assírios <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.20\">Is 7.20</a> (objetos <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֹאשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׂעַר הָרַגְלָ֑יִם</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">הַזָּקָן</span>) <strong>4.</strong>  intransitivo. <em>ele se barbeou</em> (a si mesmo) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:14\" href=\"/Genesis.41.14\">Gn 41.14</a> (E).<br><strong>Pual</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּלָּ֑ח</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:22\" href=\"/Judges.16.22\">Jz 16.22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּלַּחְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:17\" href=\"/Judges.16.17\">Jz 16.17</a>; particípio construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגֻלְּחֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.5\">Jr 41.5</a>;—<em>ser rapado</em>, sujeito pessoal (de Sansão) <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:17\" href=\"/Judges.16.17\">Jz 16.17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:22\" href=\"/Judges.16.22\">Jz 16.22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגֻלְּחֵי זָקָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.5\">Jr 41.5</a>.<br><strong>Hitpael</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִתְגַּלָּ֑ח</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.33\">Lv 13.33</a>; infinitivo com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְגַּלְּחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:19\" href=\"/Numbers.6.19\">Nm 6.19</a>;—<em>raspar-se</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.33\">Lv 13.33</a>; com acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶת־נִזְרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:19\" href=\"/Numbers.6.19\">Nm 6.19</a> (ambos P).",
